ing  taken under the wing of Henry cavils  Geralt of Rivia on the witcher allen's  first big role was as a younger version  of martial arts expert minerva a major  character on AMC's action series into  the badlands the single episode in which  Allen appeared includes a flashback to  when a teenage Minerva was enslaved by  one of the show's post-apocalyptic  barons  following a short stint on into the  badlands she landed a small role on an  installment of the BBC's 2019 miniseries  adaptation of the beloved sci-fi novel  War of the Worlds going from those roles  to standing front and center as part of  the witcher's major character triad is  one heck of a quantum leap but that  momentum is here to stay for at least  the next couple of years The Witcher was  greenlit for a second season even before  all eight episodes went live on Netflix  so that's a great sure thing for allen's  future however allen's early career  renaissance doesn't stop there  in 2020 Freya Allen will make her  feature film debut in the action  thriller gunpowder milkshake details on  the plot of gunpowder milkshake are  still slim and there's no trailer just  yet but Allen will once again play a  younger counterpart of the protagonist  in this case Karen Gillan's lead  character Eva Gillan will co-star  alongside Game of Thrones alum Lena  Headey as a mother-daughter assassin duo  out to end the head of a gang for whom  they used to kill another woman in  training for the warrior class should  feel nice and familiar for Allen now  right here's hoping Allen will be a  fresh new leader on the upward swing of  this trend of female led original action  films Allen's other project which is  still in pre-production is a British  program for Sky media's new foray into  original programming sixth episode  miniseries entitled the third day which  is about the residents of a mysterious  island who are set on preserving their  traditions at any cost  of all the actresses forthcoming  offerings The Witcher Season 2 is the  farthest out and we're sure she'll land  a few more high-profile gigs in the  meantime following her star-making turn  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  The Witcher are coming soon subscribe to  our YouTube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  you  [Music]
 

